        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ichilo ja Solomoni kwa wandu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Solomoni ukaghamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“BWANA kwaghambie kuchakaia andenyi ya kira chikambie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuaghia Hekalu ya wubaa mungi, andu kudimagha kukaia kwa kala.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mzuri ukajighalukia ikwanyiko jose ja Israeli jerekoghe kimusi ukajirasimia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukaghamba, “BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli ndekaso, angu wakatisha kwa kudima kwake agho oremlaghirieghe aba Daudi kwa momu ghwake ukighamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 7.1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mal. 17.1-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Kufuma ituku niwifunyire wandu wapo isanga ja Misri, seresaghueghe muzi ghungi andenyi ya mbari rose ra Israeli ghukaie andu koaghia hekalu, eri Irina japo jikaieghe aho; hata seremsaghueghe mndungi ukaie m'baa aighu ya wandu wapo Israeli anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela namerie kusaghua Jerusalemu eri Irina japo jikaieghe aho, na Daudi ukaie aighu ya wandu wapo Israeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Daudi orekoghe na ngolo eagha hekalu kwa wundu ghwa irina ja BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela BWANA ukamzera Aba Daudi, ‘Kwabonyere nicha kukaia na ngolo eniaghia hekalu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "elaima oho ndekuchaaniaghia iyo hekalu; mwana wako moni kuchaamva nuo uchaaniaghia iyo hekalu kwa wundu ghwa Irina japo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana BWANA wakatisha ilaghiro jake orejibonyereghe, angu nakaia wulalo ghwa Aba Daudi, na kuchiseria kifumbi cha nguma cha Israeli sa iji koni BWANA orelaghirieghe; nani nameria kuiagha hekalu kwa wundu ghwa irina ja BWANA, Mlungu wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Sanduku heja naiwika, iko na Ilaghano ja BWANA ijo orejibonyereghe na wandu wa Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilombi ja Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Solomoni ukakaia kimusi imbiri ya madhabahu ya BWANA, ikwanyiko jose ja Israeli jikiwona; ukaighorua mikonu yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni orekoghe wabonya kiwayo cha shaba, cha meta iwi na pointi iwi wulacha, na meta iwi na pointi iwi wushapa, na wuighu ghwa meta imweri na pointi idadu, ukachiwika wazenyi; nao ukajoka na kukaia kimusi aighu yaro. Niko ukadunga ngokoro imbiri ya ikwanyiko jose ja Israeli, ukaghorua mikonu yake cha mlungunyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukaghamba, “Ee BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli, ndekuwadie Mlungu ungi sa oho, mlungunyi hata ndoenyi; umaziriagha ilaghano, na kuwonyera lukundo lwake lukatie kwa wadumiki wake wose wimnughagha kwa ngolo rawo rose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oho kwajikatishire ilaghiro korejibonyereghe kwa mdumiki wako aba Daudi; korejighorieghe kwa momu ghwako, na kujikatisha kwa kudima kwako sa iji iko idime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na idana ee BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli kumkatishire aba Daudi agho koremlaghirieghe kukighamba, ‘Najingi ndekuchaasowa mundu obonya nguma aighu ya Israeli imbiri kwapo, iji wana wako wichakulindia kwa maza rose wichaabonya imbiri kwapo kunughana na sharia yapo sa iji kuikatishire ngiwona.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo idana ee BWANA, Mlungu wa Israeli, kujibonye ilagho jako koremlaghirieghe mdumiki wako Daudi jikatie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela loli Mlungu wadima kukanya na wadamu ndoenyi? Ola mlungunyi na mlungunyi kuko ighu kuchumba ndekudimagha kukukata, ichakaia ihi nyumba niiaghie!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.2.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 2.6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela sena kughitale malombi na kuvoya kwa mdumiki wako ee BWANA Mlungu wapo, kusikire kililo na malombi gha mdumiki wako ukulombagha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri kuizighaneghe hekalu ihi kio na dime, andu oho kulaghirie kukaia kuchawika Irina jako, na kusikira malombi gha mdumiki wako ukulombagha ukilangaya andu aha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.12.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuk. 12.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusikire kuvoya kwa mdumiki wako na kwa wandu wako Israeli iji wakalomba wikilangaya andu aha, ee, kusikire kufuma mlungunyi andu kukaiagha; na iji kwasikira, kufuye wughoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iji mundu wam'bonyera mmbao kaung'a, nao ikaie uaghemeshwa ukacha na kubonya ighemi jake imbiri ya madhabahu yako andenyi ya Hekalu ihi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kusikire kufuma mlungunyi, kutanye wadumiki wako; kukimlipa mkosi seji imfwanagha, na kumdederia mhachi kwa kumlipa kunughana na hachi yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
