              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iji wandu wako Israeli wasimwa imbiri ya m'maiza, angu wibonyere kaung'a, wikaghaluka na kukurumiria, nao wilombe na kukuvoya andenyi ya Hekalu ihi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kusikire kufuma mlungunyi kufuye wughoma kaung'a ya wandu wako Israeli, kuwiwunje isangenyi ijo korewinekieghe awo na weke ndee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.25"
            ]
          }
        }
