          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iji njala yangia isangenyi, angu saka izamie, mbeo angu ikungughu jeomera miwalwa angu zighe, angu vivunyu; ikakaia wamaiza wawo wawirughaia andenyi ya muzi ghungi ghwa mizi yawo, saka angu wukongo ugho ghose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mndungi angu wandu wako wose wa Israeli wikabonya ilombi angu kuvoya uko kose, kula umu ukimanya matiriro angu wasi ghwake moni, ukighorua mikonu yake ukilangaya Hekalu ihi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kusikire kufuma mlungunyi andu kukaiagha, kufuye wughoma, na kumneka kula umu seji kumwichi ngolo yake kunughana na mabonyo ghake, (angu ni oho, oho kuekeri kuichi ngolo ra wadamu); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eri wipate kukuobua oho, na kubonya lukundo lwako matuku ghose wiko moyo andenyi ya isanga kuwinekie weke aba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
